## How to Check Dependencies

### C++ Components
```bash
# Build system shows linked libraries
cmake -S . -B build && cmake --build build --verbose
```

### Go Modules
```bash
cd src/agent
go mod graph  # Show dependency tree
go list -m -json all  # List all modules with versions
```

### Firmware Components
```bash
cd pico-sdk
# Check Buildroot package list
cat buildroot/.config | grep "^BR2_PACKAGE.*=y"
```

